            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='10'><![CDATA[Casinos with >= 1 day ZERO traffic of provider during <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003100078125:ok]> ~ <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003099103274:ok]>]]></run>
