            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>or </run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10' underline='true'>Go Live Date</run>
            <run fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'> (whichever is more recent)</run>
