                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666'>*Only calculates data after go live date (based on go-live emails)</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#666666'>*Synthetic demo data — every casino, KAM, provider and figure is generated.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>50d</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'><![CDATA[ = <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003103174702:qk]> ~ <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003099103274:ok]>            ]]></run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>This week</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'><![CDATA[ = <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003100078125:ok]> ~ <[federated.1mqe74i0nqo64h14i5wmi1a94h8d].[none:Calculation_1486399003099103274:ok]>]]></run>
                <run fontalignment='0' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>Total wager (50d)</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'> = total wager in the 50d window.</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'>Potential wager</run>
                <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Benton Sans Book' lmargin='630' rmargin='630'> = each stopped provider&apos;s average daily wager (50d, days with traffic only) × its days with no traffic this week, summed per casino.</run>
